<title>RUSSIA: Air France adds Moscow-Paris daily flight.</title>
<headline>Air France adds Moscow-Paris daily flight.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France will add a third regular daily flight between Moscow and Paris from March 31, Air France's Moscow office said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The new flight is scheduled to depart Sheremetyevo airport at 7.30 p.m. Moscow time and arrive at Paris's Charles de Gaulle-2 airport at 9.15 p.m Paris time,&quot; a statement from the company said.</p>
<p>Air France will operate A-320 jets on all Paris-Moscow flights.</p>
<p>-- Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
